      "rendered": "<p><noscript><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" decoding=\"async\" data-attachment-id=\"2892\" data-permalink=\"https://3dtextures.me/2018/11/27/metal-rusted-007-2/material_substance_007/\" data-orig-file=\"https://i0.wp.com/3dtextures.me/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/material_substance_007.png?fit=600%2C800&amp;ssl=1\" data-orig-size=\"600,800\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"Material_Substance_007\" data-image-description data-image-caption data-large-file=\"https://i0.wp.com/3dtextures.me/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/material_substance_007.png?fit=600%2C800&amp;ssl=1\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-2892\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/3dtextures.me/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/material_substance_007.png?resize=600%2C800&#038;ssl=1\" alt=\"Material_Substance_007\" width=\"600\" height=\"800\"></noscript><img decoding=\"async\" data-attachment-id=\"2892\" data-permalink=\"https://3dtextures.me/2018/11/27/metal-rusted-007-2/material_substance_007/\" data-orig-file=\"https://i0.wp.com/3dtextures.me/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/material_substance_007.png?fit=600%2C800&amp;ssl=1\" data-orig-size=\"600,800\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"Material_Substance_007\" data-image-description data-image-caption data-large-file=\"https://i0.wp.com/3dtextures.me/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/material_substance_007.png?fit=600%2C800&amp;ssl=1\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-2892 lazyload\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns%3D%22http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F2000%2Fsvg%22%20viewBox%3D%220%200%20600%20800%22%3E%3C%2Fsvg%3E\" alt=\"Material_Substance_007\" width=\"600\" height=\"800\" data-src=\"https://3dtextures.me/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/material_substance_007.png\"></p>\n<p>Metal Rusted 007 – Free seamless texture, 1024&nbsp;x 1024, with the following maps:</p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"list-style-type:none;\">\n<ul>\n<li>Diffuse</li>\n<li>Normal</li>\n<li>Displacement</li>\n<li>Roughness</li>\n<li>Ambient Occlusion</li>\n<li>Metalness</li>\n</ul>\n<p><!--more--></p>\n<p><strong>For Tier 3 Patrons, there&#8217;s a 4K resolution uncompressed PNG version of this texture.</strong></p>\n<h2><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/open?id=1iHjNR5vwb8PGP089BApEHNFJnVBfRueR\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">DOWNLOAD ALL THE MAPS</a></h2>\n<p>If you like my work and you find it good enough to use on your work, consider giving me a small tip using the left menu and in return, I’ll provide you a link to the folder where I have all my textures and you can download them all with a single click.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://ko-fi.com/N4N259VG\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><noscript><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" width=\"800\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"border:0;height:36px;\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/az743702.vo.msecnd.net/cdn/kofi5.png?fit=800%2C36&#038;ssl=1\" alt=\"Buy Me a Coffee at ko-fi.com\" height=\"36\" border=\"0\"></noscript><img decoding=\"async\" style=\"border:0;height:36px;\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAIBRAA7\" alt=\"Buy Me a Coffee at ko-fi.com\" height=\"36\" border=\"0\" data-src=\"https://az743702.vo.msecnd.net/cdn/kofi5.png?v=0\" class=\" lazyload\"></a></p>\n<p>Or you can be super supportive by becoming a patron on my <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/gendo\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Patreon Page.</a> It would mean a LOT to me and you would get a ton of goodies. Take a peak on the rewards you get once you&#8217;ll be my patron.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/bePatron?c=158505\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><noscript><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" decoding=\"async\" data-attachment-id=\"1414\" data-permalink=\"https://3dtextures.me/2017/11/16/tiles-007/patreon/\" data-orig-file=\"https://i0.wp.com/3dtextures.me/wp-content/uploads/2017/11/patreon.png?fit=656%2C290&amp;ssl=1\" data-orig-size=\"656,290\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"patreon\" data-image-description data-image-cap